  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "おもたい　からだで　あいてに　ぶつかって\nこうげきする。　じぶんが　あいてより\nおもいほど　いりょくが　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "무거운 몸으로 상대에게 부딪쳐\n공격한다. 자신이 상대보다\n무거울수록 위력이 올라간다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用沉重的身體衝撞對手進行攻擊。\n體重比對手重越多，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur se jette sur l’ennemi de tout son poids.\nS’il est plus lourd que l’ennemi, l’effet augmente\nen conséquence.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Anwender rammt das Ziel mit massivem Körper.\nJe schwerer er im Vergleich zum Ziel ist, desto\nstärker die Attacke.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario golpea con todo su cuerpo. Cuanto mayor\nsea su peso comparado con el del objetivo, más daño\ncausará.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa si lancia contro il bersaglio con tutto\nil proprio peso. Più è pesante rispetto ad esso,\npiù danni causa.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user slams into the target with its heavy body.\nThe more the user outweighs the target, the greater\nthe move’s power.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "重たい　体で　相手に　ぶつかって\n攻撃する。　自分が　相手より\n重いほど　威力が　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用沉重的身体撞向对手进行攻击。\n自己比对手越重，威力越大。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario golpea con todo su cuerpo. Cuanto mayor\nsea su peso comparado con el del objetivo, más daño\ncausará.",
